#: manual/design/array_utils.md:1
msgid "Array migration design"
msgstr "数组迁移设计"

#: manual/design/array_utils.md:3
msgid "Removing the legacy helpers breaks the dependency from luna-utils to luna-generic, allowing luna-utils to become the bottom numeric layer. No compatibility wrapper or replacement trait is introduced. Applications own their folds, identities, overflow policy and empty-input policy."
msgstr "删除旧辅助函数切断 luna-utils 对 luna-generic 的依赖，使 luna-utils 成为底层数值层。此次不引入兼容包装器或替代 trait。应用自行负责 fold、单位元、溢出策略与空输入策略。"

#: manual/design/array_utils.md:5
msgid "For a finite array of length n, core fold, all, search and iterator extrema visit at most n elements and terminate when their callbacks terminate. They take O(n) time and O(1) auxiliary space; all and search may stop early. Reversal takes O(n) time: rev allocates O(n) output, rev_in_place uses O(1) auxiliary space. Array construction requires a nonnegative representable length and available memory."
msgstr "对长度为 n 的有限数组，core fold、all、search 与迭代器最值至多访问 n 个元素；回调终止时这些操作也终止。时间 O(n)，辅助空间 O(1)；all 与 search 可提前结束。反转时间 O(n)：rev 分配 O(n) 输出，rev_in_place 使用 O(1) 辅助空间。数组构造要求非负可表示长度及足够内存。"

#: manual/design/array_utils.md:7
msgid "Known downstream: calculus-numerical <= 0.3.1 used the old helpers; its WIP has a local legacy copy. Audit import sites before upgrading. Issue #6 becomes obsolete when arr_abs_sum is removed, rather than being fixed by a new numeric algorithm."
msgstr "已知下游 calculus-numerical <= 0.3.1 使用旧辅助函数，其 WIP 已有本地旧代码副本。升级前须审查导入点。arr_abs_sum 删除后 #6 将过时；这并不表示新数值算法修复了该问题。"

#: manual/design/array_utils.md:9
msgid "Implementation evidence: migration examples were checked with moon 0.1.20260920, moonc v0.10.14 and bundled core 0.10.14+7d59c7ec9. The relevant core sources are builtin/array.mbt, builtin/iterator.mbt, builtin/int.mbt, builtin/double.mbt and cmp/cmp.mbt. See the [official MoonBit documentation](https://docs.moonbitlang.com/en/latest/) for language and package rules. These are version-specific implementation observations, not formal verification or a standards-conformance proof."
msgstr "实现依据：迁移示例使用 moon 0.1.20260920、moonc v0.10.14 及随附 core 0.10.14+7d59c7ec9 检查。相关 core 源码为 builtin/array.mbt、builtin/iterator.mbt、builtin/int.mbt、builtin/double.mbt 与 cmp/cmp.mbt。语言与包规则见 [MoonBit 官方文档](https://docs.moonbitlang.com/en/latest/)。这些是版本相关的实现观察，不是形式验证或标准符合性证明。"

#: manual/design/comparison.md:1
msgid "Numeric base design"
msgstr "数值基础层设计"

#: manual/design/comparison.md:3
msgid "Future floating-point operations must define IEEE 754-2019 semantics; future integer operations must define ISO/IEC 10967-1 semantics. Definitions must state domain, exceptional inputs, rounding, error bounds, complexity and termination. Tests support those contracts but do not prove them. No such numeric implementation is added by the legacy removal."
msgstr "未来浮点操作须定义 IEEE 754-2019 语义，未来整数操作须定义 ISO/IEC 10967-1 语义。定义须说明定义域、异常输入、舍入、误差界、复杂度与终止性。测试支持这些约定但不能证明它们。旧 API 删除未添加此类数值实现。"

#: manual/design/comparison.md:5
msgid "Keep pure numeric transformations separate from flags and other effects. Backend independence must be checked on wasm, wasm-gc, js and native in debug and release, with Linux gcc and macOS clang. Issue #20 supplies the CI foundation; it does not turn empty-package builds into numeric conformance evidence."
msgstr "保持纯数值转换与标志等副作用分离。后端无关性须在 wasm、wasm-gc、js、native 的 debug/release，以及 Linux gcc、macOS clang 上检查。#20 提供 CI 基础，但空包构建不能成为数值符合性证据。"

#: manual/design/float.md:1
msgid "Float representation design"
msgstr "浮点表示设计"

#: manual/design/float.md:3
msgid "For binary64, bit 63 is sign, bits 62–52 exponent and bits 51–0 fraction; bit 51 is the quiet bit. Binary32 uses sign bit 31, exponent bits 30–23, fraction bits 22–0 and quiet bit 22. An all-one exponent means infinity when the fraction is zero and NaN otherwise. An all-zero exponent means zero when the fraction is zero and subnormal otherwise; all remaining encodings are normal."
msgstr "binary64 的位 63 为符号，位 62–52 为指数，位 51–0 为尾数字段，位 51 为 quiet 位。binary32 使用符号位 31、指数位 30–23、尾数字段位 22–0 和 quiet 位 22。指数全一且尾数字段为零表示无穷，否则为 NaN；指数全零且尾数字段为零表示零，否则为次正规数；其余编码均为正规数。"

#: manual/design/float.md:5
msgid "Raw operations use fixed-width integer masks. Classification cases are exhaustive and disjoint by the exponent/fraction partition. Sign operations preserve the magnitude mask by construction. Payload guards exclude fraction overflow and the signaling-zero infinity encoding. Every operation takes O(1) time and space with no loops or numeric rounding; termination follows from finite expressions."
msgstr "原始操作使用定宽整数掩码。指数与尾数字段的划分使分类情况穷尽且互斥。符号操作按构造保留幅值掩码。payload 检查排除尾数字段溢出及 signaling 零对应的无穷编码。所有操作的时间和空间复杂度均为 O(1)，无循环或数值舍入；有限表达式保证终止。"

#: manual/design/float.md:7
msgid "A raw integer encoding preserves NaN sign, signaling state and payload exactly. A numeric value does not preserve that information portably, especially on JavaScript. Numeric NaN is detected by `x != x`; `portable_classify` returns `QuietNaN` without inspecting its sign or payload. `portable_is_signaling` is always false, while binary interchange `is_canonical_bits` and `portable_is_canonical` are always true. Keep signaling NaNs as integers when their representation matters."
msgstr "原始整数编码精确保留 NaN 符号、信令状态和 payload。数值本身无法可移植地保留这些信息，尤其是在 JavaScript 上。数值 NaN 通过 `x != x` 检测；`portable_classify` 不检查符号或 payload，而返回 `QuietNaN`。`portable_is_signaling` 始终为 false；二进制交换格式的 `is_canonical_bits` 与 `portable_is_canonical` 始终为 true。表示重要时，请将 signaling NaN 保留为整数。"

#: manual/design/float.md:9
msgid "IEEE 754-2019 §§5.7.2, 5.5.1 and 9.7 motivate classification, sign and payload operations; §6.2 does not require identical NaN payload propagation across hosts. This package makes its canonical encoding policy explicit. It does not raise IEEE exception flags or preserve numeric signaling NaNs. Current MoonBit core 0.10.14+7d59c7ec9 and official [language documentation](https://docs.moonbitlang.com/en/latest/) provide implementation evidence, not a formal verification claim."
msgstr "分类、符号和 payload 操作依据 IEEE 754-2019 §§5.7.2、5.5.1 和 9.7；§6.2 不要求主机之间传播完全一致的 NaN payload。本包明确规定自身的规范编码策略，不设置 IEEE 异常标志，也不保留数值 signaling NaN。当前 MoonBit core 0.10.14+7d59c7ec9 及官方[语言文档](https://docs.moonbitlang.com/en/latest/)提供实现证据，不构成形式验证声明。"

#: manual/design/float.md:11
msgid "Round-to-integral operations implement IEEE 754-2019 §5.9 from the same integer fields. For a finite non-integral value, discarded fraction bits determine the nearest tie rule or directed step; values below one use the signed zero encoding or the adjacent signed one encoding for directed rounding. NaNs are quieted to positive canonical NaN, dropping the input sign and payload. The API does not report the invalid exception for sNaN input or inexact for non-integral input; both are deferred to the `_exact` variant and status-flag work in [#29](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/luna-utils/issues/29). Infinities pass through unchanged."
msgstr "整数舍入操作使用相同的整数字段实现 IEEE 754-2019 §5.9。对有限非整数值，丢弃的小数位决定最近舍入的平局规则或定向步进；绝对值小于一的值在定向舍入时使用带符号零或相邻的带符号一编码。NaN 会静默为正号规范 NaN，并丢弃输入符号和 payload。API 不报告 sNaN 输入的 invalid 异常，也不报告非整数输入的 inexact；两者留待 issue [#29](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/luna-utils/issues/29) 的状态标志工作和 `_exact` 变体。无穷保持不变。"

#: manual/design/float.md:13
msgid "Integer conversions first apply `round_to_integral` and then compare the rounded `Double` with the half-open interval of the target before calling a core primitive, since core's `to_int` family is backend-specific outside its range. Comparing after rounding is the contract: `-0.5` truncates into the `UInt` range. `UInt64` values at or above `2^63` are converted by subtracting `2^63`, converting the remainder as `Int64` and setting the top bit, because no single core primitive covers that range on every backend. `int64_to_float` and `uint64_to_float` take the magnitude, keep its top 53 bits and fold all lower bits into the last kept bit (round to odd), and then narrow that exactly representable intermediate to binary32 with a single ties-to-even rounding. Because a binary64 significand has at least two more bits than binary32, the round-to-odd intermediate preserves every rounding decision, so the result equals a direct rounding of the integer."
msgstr "整数转换先应用 `round_to_integral`，再将舍入后的 `Double` 与目标类型的半开区间比较，然后才调用 core 原语，因为 core 的 `to_int` 系列在范围之外的行为取决于后端。以舍入之后的比较为准是契约的一部分：`-0.5` 截断后落在 `UInt` 范围内。不小于 `2^63` 的 `UInt64` 值通过减去 `2^63`、将余数作为 `Int64` 转换并置位最高位来转换，因为没有任何单个 core 原语能在所有后端覆盖该范围。`int64_to_float` 和 `uint64_to_float` 取绝对值，保留最高 53 位，并将所有更低位折叠进最后保留的一位（舍入到奇数），然后只用一次平局取偶舍入将这个可精确表示的中间值收窄为 binary32。由于 binary64 的有效数比 binary32 至少多两位，舍入到奇数的中间值保留了每一个舍入判定，所以结果等于对整数的直接舍入。"

#: manual/design/float.md:15
msgid "IEEE 754-2019 §9.6 extrema first handle NaN, then compare ordinary values, with explicit bit selection for two zeros: minimum combines the sign bits with OR to choose `-0`, and maximum combines them with AND to choose `+0`. A NaN result uses this package's positive canonical quiet encoding; exception flags are not exposed here."
msgstr "IEEE 754-2019 §9.6 的极值运算先处理 NaN，再比较普通数值；两个零则通过位选择明确处理：minimum 对符号位执行 OR 以选择 `-0`，maximum 执行 AND 以选择 `+0`。NaN 结果使用本包的正号规范 quiet 编码；此处不提供异常标志。"

#: manual/design/float.md:17
msgid "IEEE 754-2019 §5.10 totalOrder is an integer ordering over the encoding, not ordinary floating comparison. For a width of `w` bits and sign mask `S`, the signed key is `bits XOR (S - 1)` for negative encodings and `bits` otherwise. Comparing these keys as signed integers reverses all lower bits for negative values and orders positive values directly. The raw-bit API applies this key without materializing a float, so it retains negative NaN, sNaN and payload ordering on every backend. The portable numeric API first canonicalizes NaNs; it therefore provides deterministic ordering for numeric values but cannot reconstruct encoding details lost by host storage."
msgstr "IEEE 754-2019 §5.10 totalOrder 是对编码进行的整数排序，并非普通浮点比较。对于宽度为 `w` 位、符号掩码为 `S` 的格式，负编码的有符号 key 为 `bits XOR (S - 1)`，非负编码的 key 就是 `bits`。将 key 作为有符号整数比较会反转负数的低位，并直接排列正数。原始位 API 不会将编码转成浮点值，因此在所有后端都保留负 NaN、sNaN 和 payload 的次序。可移植数值 API 会先规范化 NaN，因此能确定数值排序，但无法恢复主机存储时丢失的编码细节。"

#: manual/design/float.md:19
msgid "Sorting uses the same key comparator through core's in-place `sort_by`, for both arrays and mutable views. The comparator returns -1, 0 or 1 from signed key comparisons instead of subtracting keys, avoiding integer overflow."
msgstr "数组和可变视图排序都通过 core 的原地 `sort_by` 使用相同的 key 比较器。比较器根据有符号 key 比较返回 -1、0 或 1，不通过 key 相减，因此不会发生整数溢出。"

#: manual/design/float.md:21
msgid "The comparison predicates of IEEE 754-2019 §5.6.1 and §5.11 are one table: a predicate is a set of the four relations plus a flag saying whether quiet NaN operands also signal. Evaluating a predicate is therefore a mask test on the relation, which keeps the 22 names from becoming 22 hand-written functions that could disagree. The relation of two encodings uses the totalOrder key except that two zeros are equal, which gives `-0 = +0`, equal same-sign infinities and unordered NaNs without floating-point arithmetic. The result is a pair `(value, invalid)` because the package has no flags yet; once exception flags exist ([issue #29](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/luna-utils/issues/29)) the second component becomes a flag and the pair stays as a convenience."
msgstr "IEEE 754-2019 §5.6.1 和 §5.11 的比较谓词其实是一张表：一个谓词是四种关系的一个集合，加上一个标志，说明安静 NaN 操作数是否也要发信号。因此求值一个谓词就是对关系做一次掩码测试，避免 22 个名字变成 22 个可能互相不一致的手写函数。两个编码的关系使用 totalOrder 键，只是两个零相等，这样不用浮点运算就得到 `-0 = +0`、同号无穷相等和 NaN 无序。结果是一个 `(value, invalid)` 对，因为本包还没有标志；一旦有了异常标志（[issue #29](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/luna-utils/issues/29)），第二个分量会变成标志，这个对仍作为便利形式保留。"

#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "luna-utils"
msgstr "luna-utils"

#: manual/index.md:3
msgid "Version 0.2.0 is a breaking rebuild of the numeric base for Luna-Flow. The module depends only on `moonbitlang/core`; the legacy array and comparison API has been removed. At this migration stage the root package exports no functions, types or traits."
msgstr "0.2.0 是 Luna-Flow 数值基础层的不兼容重建。模块仅依赖 `moonbitlang/core`，旧数组与比较 API 已删除。在此迁移阶段，根包不导出函数、类型或 trait。"

#: manual/index.md:5
msgid "The numeric package roadmap is tracked in [issue #19](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/luna-utils/issues/19). Float representation APIs are available through [#25](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/luna-utils/issues/25), round-to-integral directions through [#24](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/luna-utils/issues/24), and IEEE extrema and total ordering through [#23](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/luna-utils/issues/23). Other planned work includes integer arithmetic, conversions, magnitude extrema, stable hash, text, bigint and software FMA. The decided location for libm is the `math` subpackage ([#30](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/luna-utils/issues/30))."
msgstr "数值包路线图由 [issue #19](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/luna-utils/issues/19) 跟踪。浮点表示 API 已由 [#25](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/luna-utils/issues/25) 提供，整数舍入方向由 [#24](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/luna-utils/issues/24) 提供，IEEE 极值和全序由 [#23](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/luna-utils/issues/23) 提供。其他规划工作包括整数算术、转换、magnitude 极值、稳定哈希、文本、bigint 和软件 FMA。libm 已确定放在 `math` 子包中（[#30](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/luna-utils/issues/30)）。"

